   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Your business offers more than fifty products for sale. Currently, you have a bookkeeper who uses a laptop with a basic spreadsheet program to track orders and maintain business records. You have five other employees who handle tasks such as inventory management and sales, but your business is small, and the only person who has computer access is the bookkeeper. Explain at least three ways an information system could benefit your business.",
